podx tools 检查现代 CLI 工具状态。

用途                      命令          状态
TOOLS

  print_tool_status "搜文本" "rg" "ripgrep"
  print_tool_status "找文件" "fd" "fd"
  print_tool_status "看文件" "bat" "bat"
  print_tool_status "处理 JSON" "jq" "jq"
  print_tool_status "处理 YAML" "yq" "yq"
  print_tool_status "看 diff" "delta" "git-delta"
  print_tool_status "改代码/查反模式" "ast-grep" "ast-grep"
